{"id":"neizvestno","lemma":"неизвестно","pos":"adj","rank":1713,"glosses":["it is not (well) known"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/17/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Её имя было неизвестно.","en":"Her name was unknown.","words":[{"g":"her"},{"g":"personal name"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Неизвестно, что он будет делать дальше.","en":"There is no knowing what he will do next.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"furthermore"}]},{"text":"Неизвестно, что случится в будущем.","en":"There is no knowing what will happen in the future.","words":[null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Мне неизвестно, что здесь происходит.","en":"I don't know what happens here.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"to take place","l":"происходить"}]},{"text":"Неизвестно, когда закончится война.","en":"There is no telling when the war will end.","words":[null,{"g":"when"},{"g":"to finish","l":"закончиться"},{"g":"war, warfare"}]}]}